<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Dig</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>dig
</pre>
<p>Digs in the ground where you stand. If anything is buried here, you dig it 
up: one thing each time you dig, so dig again if more was buried. Anyone 
can dig, not only the one who buried it. Sometimes what you find is not a 
thing at all, but someone who was buried alive.
</p><p>Things buried with <a cmd='#'>Help Bury</a> rot away after an hour of real time, so 
don't leave them too long.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Bury</a>
</pre>




</div>